WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.583
(upbeat music)

00:00:04.022 --> 00:00:07.266
- [Sam] Girls are just as
good as boys in anything.

00:00:07.266 --> 00:00:08.849
We know how to hit,

00:00:10.184 --> 00:00:11.767
we know how to run,

00:00:14.759 --> 00:00:17.380
and we can definitely play football.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:19.072
(girls chanting)

00:00:19.072 --> 00:00:20.205
- Go, go, go, go.

00:00:20.205 --> 00:00:21.955
- So, when I heard boys chanting,

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:25.493
'Beat that girl, beat that girl.'

00:00:25.493 --> 00:00:28.634
All it made me want to do
was beat them even better.

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:31.384
(girls chanting)

00:00:33.741 --> 00:00:36.324
(upbeat music)

00:00:37.959 --> 00:00:40.218
- I'm Sam Gordon, I'm 14 years old,

00:00:40.218 --> 00:00:44.289
and I started the first
female tackle football league.

00:00:44.289 --> 00:00:48.456
I've been playing with the boys
since I was nine years old.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:54.350
In my very first season
I scored 35 touchdowns,

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:56.183
about like 1900 yards.

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:58.169
Sometimes after I beat them

00:00:58.169 --> 00:01:00.188
the parents would come out onto the field

00:01:00.188 --> 00:01:02.792
and grab their son's
face mask and be like,

00:01:02.792 --> 00:01:05.125
'Don't let a girl beat you.'

00:01:06.001 --> 00:01:08.036
I wanted to start the girls
tackle football league

00:01:08.036 --> 00:01:10.263
after talking at a school assembly

00:01:10.263 --> 00:01:11.884
and asking the question,

00:01:11.884 --> 00:01:15.244
'How many girls here would
want to play tackle football?'

00:01:15.244 --> 00:01:17.361
Almost every hand in the room went up.

00:01:17.361 --> 00:01:19.003
So, I got the idea, like, okay,

00:01:19.003 --> 00:01:20.684
if there's this many at this one school,

00:01:20.684 --> 00:01:22.432
imagine how many there are in Utah,

00:01:22.432 --> 00:01:23.964
or just in the nation.

00:01:23.964 --> 00:01:26.265
So, I talked to my dad and he
talked with some other people.

00:01:26.265 --> 00:01:28.175
After a while we had the first season

00:01:28.175 --> 00:01:32.342
of the Utah Girls Tackle
Football League up and running.

00:01:33.786 --> 00:01:34.749
(whistle blowing)

00:01:34.749 --> 00:01:37.576
(man shouting)

00:01:37.576 --> 00:01:40.325
- Football is the last
frontier in girls sports.

00:01:40.325 --> 00:01:41.608
And if you think about it,

00:01:41.608 --> 00:01:44.405
girls can play on girls
teams in every sport

00:01:44.405 --> 00:01:45.357
that you can think of,

00:01:45.357 --> 00:01:48.215
except for the country's
most popular sport.

00:01:48.215 --> 00:01:50.606
(people shouting)

00:01:50.606 --> 00:01:51.807
(whistle blowing)

00:01:51.807 --> 00:01:54.450
We limited participation to 50 girls,

00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:56.592
those spots filled up in less than a week.

00:01:56.592 --> 00:01:58.590
The following year we had a hundred girls,

00:01:58.590 --> 00:01:59.640
and then this season

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:02.651
we've had over 200 girls who are playing.

00:02:02.651 --> 00:02:03.941
(people shouting)

00:02:03.941 --> 00:02:05.024
- [Sam] Every year we keep getting bigger,

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:06.127
and bigger, and bigger.

00:02:06.127 --> 00:02:08.449
(girls chanting)

00:02:08.449 --> 00:02:10.956
It would be amazing for it
to go into high schools,

00:02:10.956 --> 00:02:14.007
colleges, and even its
own professional league.

00:02:14.007 --> 00:02:15.956
And that's going to be
a tough goal to reach,

00:02:15.956 --> 00:02:19.687
but I am really ambitious, and
I feel like we could do it.

00:02:19.687 --> 00:02:20.702
With the girls, you could tell

00:02:20.702 --> 00:02:22.865
that everybody really wants to be there.

00:02:22.865 --> 00:02:24.376
And so, everybody is just super into it

00:02:24.376 --> 00:02:25.785
and always willing to learn.

00:02:25.785 --> 00:02:27.225
(upbeat music)

00:02:27.225 --> 00:02:30.345
And with the girls every
practice is just an awesome time.

00:02:30.345 --> 00:02:32.928
(upbeat music)

